    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Claude Desktop Theme",
      "text": "为 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）Desktop 换上 Claude Code Desktop 外观\n\n简体中文 · [English](https://github.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/blob/main/README.en.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Claude Desktop Theme",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-3DA639?style=for-the-badge&logo=opensourceinitiative&logoColor=white\" alt=\"License\"/>\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-claude-desktop-theme\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/npm-package-4D6BFE?style=for-the-badge&logo=npm&logoColor=white\" alt=\"npm\"/></a>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DSH-Desktop-4D6BFE?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"DSH\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Platform-macOS%20%7C%20Windows-0078D4?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Platform\"/>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Claude Desktop Theme",
      "text": "[安装](#快速安装) · [界面预览](#界面预览) · [配置](#配置) · [架构](https://github.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/blob/main/ARCHITECTURE.md) · [设计规范](https://github.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/blob/main/DESIGN.md) · [安装指南](https://github.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/blob/main/install.md) · [问题反馈](https://github.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/issues)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Claude Desktop Theme",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/screenshots/fullscreen-light.webp\" width=\"1200\" alt=\"新会话页：浅色主题、Claude 像素宠物、用量统计与字符水波纹\">\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速安装",
      "text": "[npm 包](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-claude-desktop-theme)已发布，两种入口任选其一：\n\n- **插件页**：「插件 → 添加插件」，输入 `dsh-claude-desktop-theme`\n- **终端**：`dsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-claude-desktop-theme`\n\n源码安装见[安装指南](https://github.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/blob/main/install.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "在「设置 → Claude 主题 → 模块 → 主页背景动效」选择「宠物畅游」，像素宇航员会缓缓跟随鼠标，点击空白处会划过流星。也可切回默认的字符水波纹或关闭背景动效。\n\n会话中输入 `/clear` 可以清空当前对话上下文，继续使用同一个会话：会话 ID、名称、项目、模型、项目指令与技能目录保留，旧消息和工具结果不再发送给模型。原始日志仍在，「查看历史记录」可展开旧内容，查看不会恢复模型上下文。命令不调用模型、不生成摘要；请在回复结束且没有排队消息时执行。安装后需完整退出并重新打开 DSH，加载宿主命令。"
    },
    {
      "section": "界面预览",
      "text": "以下展示 macOS 浅色与深色主题的完整窗口。首页使用 Claude 像素宠物与问候样式，开启水波纹和统计卡片；会话页展示终端、浏览器与文件栏，信息卡片单独展示环境、上下文分解与会话用量。两种宠物的点击回应与 Effort 拉到底的动效见下一节。\n\n| 界面 | 浅色 | 深色 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 新会话页 |  |  |\n| 会话页 |  |  |\n| 右侧信息卡片 |  |  |\n| 插件设置 |  |  |"
    },
    {
      "section": "组件特写",
      "text": "| 组件 | 浅色 | 深色 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 模型选择器 |  |  |\n| DeepSeek 余额 |  |  |\n| 上下文圆环与分解面板 |  |  |\n| 会话右侧信息卡片 |  |  |"
    },
    {
      "section": "细节动效",
      "text": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/pet/pet-spout.gif\" width=\"150\" alt=\"喷一口水：身体轻晃、闭眼，从头顶喷出水柱，水滴向两侧散开落下\"><br/>\n<b>喷一口水</b><br/>\n身体轻晃、闭眼，从头顶喷出水柱，水滴向两侧散开落下\n</td>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/pet/pet-hop.gif\" width=\"150\" alt=\"轻弹眨眼：蓄力、向上轻跳、落地回弹并眨眼\"><br/>\n<b>轻弹眨眼</b><br/>\n蓄力、向上轻跳、落地回弹并眨眼\n</td>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/pet/pet-wag.gif\" width=\"150\" alt=\"摆尾回应：身体左右轻晃，尾巴与胸鳍摆动并眨眼\"><br/>\n<b>摆尾回应</b><br/>\n身体左右轻晃，尾巴与胸鳍摆动并眨眼\n</td>\n<td width=\"25%\" align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/pet/pet-claude.gif\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Claude 像素宠物：取出笔记本电脑、敲键盘，再收起电脑恢复站姿\"><br/>\n<b>Claude 像素宠物</b><br/>\n取出笔记本电脑、敲键盘，再恢复站姿\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "细节动效",
      "text": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/effort/effort-light.gif\" width=\"260\" alt=\"浅色 Effort 面板：滑杆停在 Max，实心填充淡出，像素流光从右端扫入并在轨道上持续流动\"><br/>\n<b>Effort 拉到底 · 浅色</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/effort/effort-dark.gif\" width=\"260\" alt=\"深色 Effort 面板：同一条像素流光，亮紫像素落在深色轨道上\"><br/>\n<b>Effort 拉到底 · 深色</b>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "细节动效",
      "text": "</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "打开侧栏「主题」或「设置 → Claude 主题」，改动即时生效：\n\n| 分组 | 可调项 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 模块 | 左侧栏、右侧栏（独立启停）、新建页、主页背景动效（字符水波纹、宠物畅游或关闭，默认水波纹）、聊天页、工具调用展示、输入框宠物、统计卡片（默认开启）、状态栏统计读数（默认关闭）、上下文分解面板 |\n| 外观 | 主题（浅色 / 深色 / 跟随系统）、会话背景色、侧栏背景色 |\n| 视图 | 显示 API 余额、显示模型图标、分开显示模型与思考强度、过程默认展开（默认开启）；DeepSeek Harness 品牌条目、顶栏子代理入口、顶栏团队入口、顶栏后台任务入口、显示空分组（默认均关闭） |\n| 个性化 | 宠物样式、输出中状态、回复签名、首页问候（默认 Claude 样式，宠物、签名与问候可分别关闭） |\n| 字体 | 界面字体、代码与等宽字体；界面中文字体在设置页不列，需写进 profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml` |"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "> [!NOTE]\n> 自定义背景色只作用于浅色模式，深色模式使用内置深色调色板。默认界面西文、中文与代码字体分别为 Anthropic Sans Web、Anthropic Serif Web 与 SF Mono，未安装时沿字体栈回退；仓库的 `assets/fonts/` 提供本机安装用字体与 OFL 许可，字体不包含在 npm 包中。"
    },
    {
      "section": "环境要求",
      "text": "DSH Desktop 版本声明范围为 `>=0.2.1-rc.3 <0.3.0-0`，允许后续 `0.2.x` 正式版与预发布版（含 `0.2.2-rc.1`）安装；放宽版本声明不代表已完成所有版本的实机验证。macOS（Apple 芯片）已使用 rc5 实机核验，开发 SDK 保持 rc3 基线。Windows 10 及以上（64 位）的安装入口保留，Windows rc5 实机尚未验证。源码构建另需 Node.js ≥ 22.18.0。升级后请完整退出并重新打开 DSH，以加载宿主接口与会话投影。"
    },
    {
      "section": "反馈与许可",
      "text": "点击侧栏左下角账号旁的反馈按钮，填写描述后会打开预填好环境信息的 GitHub Issue；也可以直接通过 [Issue](https://github.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/issues) 反馈问题，附上 DSH 版本、窗口尺寸和复现步骤。\n\n[MIT](./LICENSE) © 2026 zkforge。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Claude Desktop Theme",
      "text": "Bring the Claude Code Desktop look to DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Desktop.\n\n[简体中文](README.md) · English\n\n[Install](#quick-install) · [Screenshots](#screenshots) · [Configuration](#configuration) · [Architecture](ARCHITECTURE.md) · [Installation guide](install.md) · [Report an issue](https://github.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/issues)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Claude Desktop Theme",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/screenshots/fullscreen-light.webp\" width=\"1200\" alt=\"New session in the light theme, with the Claude pixel companion, usage statistics and animated ripples\">\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick install",
      "text": "In DSH, open **Plugins → Add plugin** and enter `dsh-claude-desktop-theme`, or run:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-claude-desktop-theme\n```\n\nFor installation from source and platform-specific CLI paths, see the [installation guide](install.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Using the theme",
      "text": "Under **Settings → Claude Theme → Modules → Home background animation**, choose **Space explorer** for a pixel astronaut that drifts toward the mouse. Click an empty area to send a shooting star across the sky. You can also choose character ripples or turn the animation off."
    },
    {
      "section": "Using the theme",
      "text": "Enter `/clear` in a conversation to clear its model context while keeping the same session, name, project, model, project instructions and skills. The original log remains available through **View history**. Run the command after the response finishes and the message queue is empty. Fully quit and reopen DSH after installation to load the host command."
    },
    {
      "section": "Screenshots",
      "text": "The previews show the macOS light and dark themes. The home page uses the Claude companion and greeting, ripples, and the statistics card.\n\n| Screen | Light | Dark |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| New session |  |  |\n| Conversation |  |  |\n| Session information |  |  |\n| Settings |  |  |\n| Model picker |  |  |\n| Context breakdown |  |  |\n\nClick the whale or Claude companion to play its reaction. Select the companion under **Settings → Claude Theme → Personalization → Pet style**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Screenshots",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/pet/pet-spout.gif\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Whale spouting water\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/pet/pet-hop.gif\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Whale hopping\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/pet/pet-wag.gif\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Whale wagging its tail\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/pet/pet-claude.gif\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Claude companion typing on a laptop\">\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Screenshots",
      "text": "The highest effort setting adds an animated pixel effect.\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/effort/effort-light.gif\" width=\"260\" alt=\"Effort animation in the light theme\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zkforge/dsh-claude-desktop-theme/main/assets/effort/effort-dark.gif\" width=\"260\" alt=\"Effort animation in the dark theme\">\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "Open **Theme** in the sidebar or **Settings → Claude Theme**. Changes take effect immediately."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "| Group | Options |\n| --- | --- |\n| Modules | Sidebars, new session, home background animation, conversation, tool calls, composer companion, statistics card, status-bar statistics and context breakdown |\n| Appearance | System, light or dark theme, conversation background and sidebar background |\n| View | API balance, model icons, separate model and effort controls, conversation process, sidebar brand, header entries and empty groups |\n| Personalization | Companion, running status, reply signature and home greeting styles |\n| Typefaces | Interface and code fonts. The Chinese interface font can be set in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`. |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
